# An allowlist: nothing goes into the image unless it is named here. Anything
# new stays out by default -- a .env with real secrets, a puzzle file in
# output/ with its answers, a .venv built for Windows.
*
!config/
!game/
!puzzle_generator/
!manage.py
!pyproject.toml

# Bytecode from a local run, compiled for whatever Python made it.
**/__pycache__
